--- !u!114 &64516685
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 64516683}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dear Grandson,\n\nI hope this letter finds you well. I\u2019m sure life\u2019s
    kept you busy in the big city, but I\u2019m writing because things here in the
    village aren\u2019t what they used to be.\n\nEver since the Factory shut down,
    folks around here have been having a tough time. You know how it is\u2014we used
    to be a close-knit community, always helping each other out, living off the land,
    and sharing what we had. But when the factory opened, many of our neighbors started
    relying on it more than on each other. Now that it\u2019s gone, well, things
    just aren\u2019t the same.\n\nThe river that used to flow so strong has nearly
    dried up. I\u2019m not sure what happened, but it\u2019s causing more problems
    than I can count. Without the water, it\u2019s hard to keep the farms going,
    and people seem to have lost that sense of purpose we used to share. Some folks
    are feeling lost, while others are downright angry. It\u2019s like the heart\u2019s
    been taken out of the village, and now everyone\u2019s struggling to find their
    place again.\n\nI hate to burden you, but I think your old grandpa could use
    a bit of help. Maybe if you came back for a spell, you could remind folks of
    what really matters\u2014community, hard work, and looking out for one another.\n\nYou
    being here would certain lift my spirits.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you soon,\nGrandpa"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3c3dd0250e80ef46906e393652a883c, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2967027995557698740, guid: c3c3dd0250e80ef46906e393652a883c, type: 2}
